{
  "id": 79805993,
  "iid": 1049,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "packet-tls-utils:Move ssl_sha_init() and ssl_md5_init() out of a loop",
  "description": "Instead of calling ssl_sha_init() and ssl_sha_cleanup() in\na loop, call the newly-created ssl_sha_reset(), to avoid\ncreating and releasing contexts.\nAlso, do the same for ssl_md5_init() and ssl_md5_cleanup().\n\nBesides the performance improvement,\nthis should also fix Coverity 1450156 and 1450693,\nwhich detect the multiple calls to ssl_sha_cleanup()\nand ssl_md5_cleanup() as a double-free.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2020-11-27T14:54:58.392Z",
  "updated_at": "2020-12-02T13:55:28.872Z",
